    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "共演者さんは白が好きって●●●●プロデューサーが\n調べてきてくれたから、色は白で統一しようか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "花言葉もピッタリだしね！\n白いアネモネの花言葉は『希望』なんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "『希望』……。誕生日に贈る\nフラワーアレンジメントにはピッタリですね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ、こっちの白いガーベラも使ってみようか。\n同じように『希望』の花言葉を持ってるんだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでは、贈る花は\n白いアネモネやガーベラをメインに？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん、そうするよ。……それじゃ、\n花も選び終わったし。ここからは、俺に任せて！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_011_01_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_011_01_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふう、こんな感じかな。\nどう思う？　●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "011min",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 19
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
